{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Ninpuchi! is a </i></strong><i>Rogue-like action game<strong>.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An exhilarating roguelike action game where you control a group of unique ninjas to defeat oncoming monsters. 3-player party strategy and free character building allow you to create your own unique adventure!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25a0Basic rule</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371270/extras/Timeline-1.gif?t=1745444772\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat monsters and defeat bosses within the time limit. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your character by acquiring random skills when leveling up. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch between 3-person parties in real time to strategically attack.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25a0Character development elements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371270/extras/menu2.gif?t=1745444772\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the &quot;store,&quot; coins earned in stages are used to raise the basic abilities common to all characters. By trying difficult stages over and over again, both the characters and the players themselves can grow and clear the stage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25a0Unlock element</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371270/extras/hard2.gif?t=1745444772\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finding three &quot;secrets&quot; (hidden items) hidden somewhere in a NORMAL stage will bring you to the HARD mode, a higher difficulty level. In addition, new characters and skills can be unlocked by clearing stages and meeting certain conditions.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3371270?t=1745444772","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371270/bceca53d43116fb869495e763a5822f4f217ae30/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745444772","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371270/284e5b32d281d7d1f7377c3008f0813266d846ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745444772","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371270/284e5b32d281d7d1f7377c3008f0813266d846ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745444772","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3440560,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Ninpuchi! is a </i></strong><i>Rogue-like action game<strong>.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An exhilarating roguelike action game where you control a group of unique ninjas to defeat oncoming monsters. 3-player party strategy and free character building allow you to create your own unique adventure!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25a0Basic rule</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371270/extras/Timeline-1.gif?t=1745444772\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat monsters and defeat bosses within the time limit. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your character by acquiring random skills when leveling up. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch between 3-person parties in real time to strategically attack.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25a0Character development elements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371270/extras/menu2.gif?t=1745444772\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the &quot;store,&quot; coins earned in stages are used to raise the basic abilities common to all characters. By trying difficult stages over and over again, both the characters and the players themselves can grow and clear the stage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25a0Unlock element</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371270/extras/hard2.gif?t=1745444772\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finding three &quot;secrets&quot; (hidden items) hidden somewhere in a NORMAL stage will bring you to the HARD mode, a higher difficulty level. In addition, new characters and skills can be unlocked by clearing stages and meeting certain conditions.</p>","developers":["CRYPTOFANTASY"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371270/e8405ca74a556c1f867ae8928ed78a72cd08a28f/header.jpg?t=1745444772","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OSX<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL\u306b\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3057\u305f\u3082\u306e<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257093997,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257093997/movie480.mp4?t=1741383286","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257093997/movie_max.mp4?t=1741383286"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257093997/d04ab618008504d126defaf5c696906df2fe019b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741383286","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257093997/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741383286","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257093997/movie_max_vp9.